  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock id="HHC9E9219375AC2F82A8CDFAF00D88FECC" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.6px;"&gt;None.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock id="HHD790CCB2EDB33AB49E3957CEAFD4E7D7" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.6px;"&gt;None.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock>
  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HHFB845F6A13C048AB10E053139FD9FDD6" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol style="margin: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt;" type="1"&gt;
&lt;li style="margin-left: 20.29pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; padding-left: 15.46pt; font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: normal;"&gt;Regulatory Reporting and Presentation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The accompanying financial statements are prepared in accordance with the accounting requirements of the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission ("FERC"), as set forth in its applicable Uniform System of Accounts and published accounting releases and orders received by &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;DCR Transmission, L.L.C. (the &amp;#8220;Company&amp;#8221;, &amp;#8220;DCRT&amp;#8221;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;, 'we", "our", or "us"), which is a comprehensive basis of accounting other than generally accepted accounting principles in the United States of America, ("US GAAP"). The accompanying financial statements are prepared considering specific FERC reporting requirements and orders received by DCRT.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: right; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol style="margin: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt;" start="2" type="1"&gt;
&lt;li style="margin-left: 20.29pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; padding-left: 15.46pt; font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: normal;"&gt;Business and Organization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 35.7pt; text-indent: 0.05pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;DCRT was formed on August 13, 2015, to develop, construct and operate an approximately 125-mile long, 500 kV transmission line (further referred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#8220;Ten&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;West&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Link&amp;#8221;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;or&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#8220;TWL&amp;#8221;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;between&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Delaney&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Substation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Arizona&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the Colorado River Substation in California.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The Company was a development stage company until the commercial operation date on June 12, 2024 (the &amp;#8220;Commercial Operation Date&amp;#8221;), and, as such, had no operations through June 11, 2024.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The Company is wholly owned by DCR Holdings, LLC (&amp;#8220;HoldCo&amp;#8221;), which is wholly owned by DCR Transmission Holdings, LLC (&amp;#8220;Parent&amp;#8221;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.8pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 35.6pt; text-indent: 0.05pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;On September 15, 2015 (&amp;#8220;219 Effective Date&amp;#8221;), pursuant to Section 219 of the Federal Power Act (the &amp;#8220;FPA&amp;#8221;), DCRT requested authorization from the FERC for certain incentive rate treatments for TWL to incentivize the Company to pursue the development, permitting, financing, construction and operation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;TWL.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;More&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;specifically,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;DCRT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;requested&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;that&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;FERC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;authorize&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;to establish a regulatory asset for (A) all prudently incurred pre-commercial costs with respect to TWL, and (B) a carrying charge on such prudently incurred pre-commercial costs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;In addition, the Company requested approval&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;to seek recovery of 100% of any prudently incurred costs in the event TWL must be abandoned for reasons outside of the Company&amp;#8217;s reasonable control. The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Commission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;approved&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Company&amp;#8217;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.35pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;request&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.35pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;17,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;2015&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.35pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;(the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#8220;Approved&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt;Order&amp;#8221;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 1pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 35.3pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;DCRT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;indirectly&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;funded&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;by&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Parent,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;which&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;was&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;also&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;formed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;August&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;13, 2015.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;At the time of its formation, Parent was indirectly owned by DCR Investor, LLC (&amp;#8220;DCR Investor&amp;#8221;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;On&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;October 29, 2015 (&amp;#8220;Inception&amp;#8221;),&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the limited&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;liability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;agreement of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Parent was amended and restated to bring in an additional member and start funding the Company and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the development of TWL.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;At Inception, DCR Investor owned 75% of Parent and another noncontrolling member owned the other 25%.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;On February 28, 2017, the noncontrolling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;member&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;sold&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;its&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;investment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;DCR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Investor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;increased&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;its&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;ownership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;87.5%. The other 12.5% interest in Parent was acquired by ABY Holdings USA, LLC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 35.3pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 35.3pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol style="margin: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt;" start="3" type="1"&gt;
&lt;li style="margin-right: 263.5pt; margin-left: 19.59pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; padding-left: 15.71pt; font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: normal;"&gt;Summary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.55pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: normal;"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.55pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: normal;"&gt;Significant&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.55pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: normal;"&gt;Accounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.55pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: normal;"&gt;Policies &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 263.5pt 0pt 35.3pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 263.5pt 0pt 35.3pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Use&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt;Estimates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 35.3pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;preparation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;financial&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;statements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;conformity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; FERC accounting requirements &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;requires management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;make estimates and assumptions that affect the reported amounts of assets and liabilities and disclosure of contingent assets and liabilities, at the date of the financial&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;statements and the reported amounts of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;revenues&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;expenses during&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;reporting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;period.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Significant&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;estimates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;assumptions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;may include, but are not limited to, the useful lives of long-lived assets and valuation of asset retirement obligation and all derivative financial instruments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Actual results could differ from those estimates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 35.3pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 35.75pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Regulatory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.7pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt;Accounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0.5pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Pursuant to the Approved Project Sponsor Agreement (&amp;#8220;APSA&amp;#8221;) executed between DCRT and the California Independent System Operator Corporation (&amp;#8220;CAISO&amp;#8221;), DCRT is a Participating&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Transmission Owner (&amp;#8220;PTO&amp;#8221;), a role which was formalized upon commercial operation of Ten&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;West Link through the Transmission Access Charge.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;As of the Commercial Operation Date, DCRT is subject to the regulatory jurisdiction of FERC, which issues orders pertaining to rates and recovery of certain costs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The electric transmission operations of the Company meet&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;GAAP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;accounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;standard&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;that&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;recognizes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; FERC-regulated &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;cost-based&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;rate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;setting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;process,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;which could result in differences in the application of US GAAP.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The FERC-regulated ratemaking process results in the recording of regulatory assets or regulatory liabilities based on the probability of current and future estimated cash flows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Regulatory assets represent incurred or accrued costs that have been deferred because they are probable of future recovery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Regulatory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;liabilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;may&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;represent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;collections&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;customers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;that&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;have been deferred because they will be expended in the future, or they may relate to the future cost of removal of assets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 1.1pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 35.7pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Cash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Cash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt;Equivalents&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;considers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;all&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;highly&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;liquid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;investments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;purchased&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;an&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;original&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;maturity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;three months or less to be cash equivalents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The carrying amount of these instruments approximates fair value because of their short-term maturity. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 35.7pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Property, Plant and Equipment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Property, plant, and equipment is recorded at cost and is being depreciated over an estimated life between 36 and 60 years using the straight-line method. FERC reporting requirements prescribe that the historical accumulated depreciation associated with the assets be maintained and reported in the Company general ledger system. The estimated group life was based on average service life estimates of peer electric transmission plants. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Depreciation expense was $2,902,263 and $2,529,689 for the three months ended &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;March 31, 2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; and 2025, respectively, and is included in Depreciation, amortization, and accretion on the Statement of Operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; All new property and equipment is being depreciated on a straight-line basis over the estimated useful lives of the respective assets. As of March 31, 2026, and December 31, 2025, transmission plant accumulated depreciation amounted to $20,574,792 and $17,672,529, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 14pt 38.15pt 14pt 36pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The Company evaluates its long-lived assets for impairment as events or changes in circumstances indicate the carrying value of these assets may not be fully recoverable. If the undiscounted future cash flows before interest associated with the expected uses and eventual disposition of those assets are not greater than the carrying value of those assets, the Company would record an impairment loss based on the fair value of the asset. There was no impairment of long-lived assets as of March 31, 2026.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 14pt 38.15pt 14pt 36pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The Company has identified certain electric transmission assets that will not contribute to future cash flow due to regulatory directives. These assets, while not impaired under the applicable &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;accounting guidance, are considered unrecoverable for ratemaking or cost recovery purposes. As such, they are excluded from the Company&amp;#8217;s rate base and are not expected to be recovered through future revenues. These unrecoverable assets remain in service and continue to provide operational support to the transmission network. The Company will continue to depreciate these assets over their remaining useful lives. The net book value of these unrecoverable but non-impaired assets was $7,382,629 and $7,419,631 as of March 31, 2026 and December 31, 2025, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The Company continues to monitor these assets and will reassess their recoverability and impairment status as conditions warrant.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Construction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.45pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.45pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.35pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Progress&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.35pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Regulatory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.45pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt;Asset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0.5pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Project development costs, which include permitting, preconstruction, construction, and administrative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;costs,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;directly&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;attributable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Company,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;have been&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;capitalized&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Construction work in progress on the Balance Sheet until the Commercial Operation Date. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0.5pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0.5pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Once operational, such amounts are depreciated over future periods consistent with the period of expected recovery authorized by FERC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;As of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; 31, 2024, project development costs in relation to two Large Generator Interconnection Agreements (each an &amp;#8220;LGIA&amp;#8221;) obligating the Company to build switchyards connecting solar facilities to the grid through Ten West Link (see Note 9) were capitalized as Construction work in progress on the Balance Sheet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;On January 31, 2025, one of the switchyards became commercially operational with $90,873,035 being capitalized out of Construction work in progress balance of $97,369,696 in 2024.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;As of March 31, 2026, and December 31, 2025 project development costs totaling $21,358,080 and $20,552,897, respectively, are capitalized as Construction work in progress on the Balance Sheet. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Accounts Receivable and Revenue Recognition &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; color: #474747; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;Company recognizes revenue throughout the year based on its Transmission Revenue Requirement (TRR), which sets a fixed annual revenue target, ensuring predictable income regardless of actual usage. This aligns with the Company's performance obligations to maintain and operate transmission infrastructure for reliable electricity delivery to load-serving entities. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;Under the contract with the California Independent System Operator (CAISO), customers are billed based on actual usage, calculated using the TRR and estimated load. The performance obligation is satisfied by providing continuous access to the transmission network, with revenue recognized over time as this service is delivered.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 14pt 38.15pt 14pt 36pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;Any discrepancies between billed amounts and the TRR are managed through the Transmission Revenue Balancing Account (TRBA), recorded as regulatory liabilities or assets, ensuring proper handling of over- or under-recovery in line with regulatory requirements. This method ensures the financial statements accurately reflect the Company's operations and commitments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;As of March 31, 2026 and December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;31, 2025, accounts receivable consists primarily of amounts owed to the Company from California Independent System Operator (CAISO), with a balance of approximately $7,142,934 and $7,131,324, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;If the customer receivable balance should be deemed uncollectible, it could have a material effect on the Company&amp;#8217;s results of operations and financial condition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;However, management does not believe significant credit risk exists as of March 31, 2026 and December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;31, 2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Accounts receivable balances would be adjusted for any write-offs and any estimated allowance for credit losses, which is reviewed periodically based on amounts past due and significance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;There was no allowance for credit losses recorded as of March 31, 2026 and December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;31, 2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 35.65pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 35.65pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Other Income (Expense)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0.5pt 33.85pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;As a FERC regulated utility, DCRT accrues AFUDC on capital spending for rate-regulated projects for which a return on such costs is recovered after the project is placed in service. The debt component of AFUDC is credited to Interest expense and the equity component is credited to Other income on the Statements of Operations. For the three months ended March 31, 2026 and 2025, the Company capitalized and recorded AFUDC within Property, plant and equipment and Regulatory assets on the Balance Sheets and corresponding Other income (expense) totaling $623,306 and $400,000, respectively. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.7pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 35.7pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Income&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt;Taxes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Given the Company&amp;#8217;s status as a FERC-regulated public utility, the Company accounts for income taxes using the accrual method.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;This practice requires the recognition of deferred tax assets and liabilities for the expected future tax consequences attributable to differences between the financial statement carrying amounts of existing assets and liabilities and their respective tax bases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Deferred tax assets, representing future tax benefits, are recognized to the extent that their realization is more likely&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;than&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;not&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;occur. The deferred tax provision or benefit represents the change in the deferred tax assets and liabilities from the prior year. Although the Company is a single member LLC disregarded for US tax purposes, management has elected to record a tax provision on a separate return basis as the Company&amp;#8217;s results are included in the corporate tax return of its owner.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Valuation allowances are established when necessary to reduce deferred tax assets to the amount that is more likely than not to be realized.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The Company considers the future taxable income and ongoing tax planning strategies in assessing the need for a valuation allowance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;As of March 31, 2026 and December 31, 2025, management determined no valuation allowances were necessary. Deferred taxes presented in these statements are prepared&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;separate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;basis as&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;single&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;member&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;LLC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.6pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;accounts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;uncertainty&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;income&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;taxes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;accordance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;guidance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;issued&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;by&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the Financial Accounting Standards Board (&amp;#8220;FASB&amp;#8221;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;A tax position is recognized as a benefit only if it is &amp;#8220;more likely than not&amp;#8221; that the tax position&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;would&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;be&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;sustained&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;tax&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;examination,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;tax&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;examination&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;being&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;presumed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;occur. The amount recognized is the largest amount that is greater than 50% likely of being realized on examination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;For tax positions not meeting the &amp;#8220;more likely than not&amp;#8221; test, no tax benefit is recorded.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;As of March 31, 2026 and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; 31, 2025, there were no uncertain tax positions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 35.7pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Fair&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt;Measurements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0.5pt 33.95pt 0pt 35.7pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;DCRT utilizes valuation techniques that maximize the use of observable inputs and minimize the use of unobservable inputs, to the extent possible.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;DCRT determines fair value based on assumptions that market participants would use in pricing an asset or liability in the principal or most advantageous market.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;When considering market participant assumptions in fair value measurements,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;fair value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;hierarchy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;distinguishes between&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;observable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;unobservable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;inputs. As of March 31, 2026 and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; 31, 2025, the carrying values of cash and cash equivalents, accounts payable and accrued expenses, approximate fair value due to the short-term maturities of these instruments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 33pt 0pt 35.7pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;DCRT applies the US GAAP accounting provisions related to fair value measurements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;These provisions define fair value as the price that would be received to sell an asset or paid to transfer a liability in an&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;orderly&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;transaction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;between&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;market&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;participants&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;measurement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;date,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;establish&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;hierarchy that&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;prioritizes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;information&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;used&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;developing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;fair&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;estimates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;require&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;disclosure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;fair value measurements by level within the fair value hierarchy. The hierarchy gives the highest priority to quoted prices in active markets (Level 1 measurements) and the lowest priority to unobservable data (Level 3 measurements), such as the reporting entity&amp;#8217;s own data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;These provisions also provide valuation techniques, such as the market approach (comparable market prices),&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;income&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;approach&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;(present&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;future&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;income&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;or&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;cash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;flows)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;cost&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;approach (cost to replace the service capacity of an asset or replacement cost).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 33pt 0pt 35.7pt; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 33pt 0pt 35.7pt; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;A financial instrument&amp;#8217;s categorization within the valuation hierarchy is based upon the lowest level of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;input&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;that&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;significant&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;fair&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;measurement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;three&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;levels&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;valuation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;hierarchy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;are defined as follows:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.65pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.85pt 0pt 93.3pt; text-indent: -57.6pt; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Level 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 25.3pt; text-indent: 0pt; display: inline-block; -aw-tabstop-align: left; -aw-tabstop-pos: 93.25pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Observable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;inputs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;such&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;quoted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;prices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;(unadjusted)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;identical&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;assets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;or&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;liabilities in active markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.6pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 40pt 0pt 93.25pt; text-indent: -57.6pt; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Level 2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 25.35pt; text-indent: 0pt; display: inline-block; -aw-tabstop-align: left; -aw-tabstop-pos: 93.25pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Inputs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;other&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;than&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;quoted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;prices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;similar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;assets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;liabilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;active&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;markets,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;and inputs that are observable for the asset or liability, either directly or indirectly, for &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;substantially the full term of the financial instrument.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.6pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 35.65pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Level&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2.25pt; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Unobservable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;inputs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;that&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;reflect&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Company&amp;#8217;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;own&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt;assumptions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 1pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The methods described above may produce a fair value calculation that may not be indicative of net&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;realizable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;or&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;reflective&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;future&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;fair&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;values. Furthermore,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;although&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;valuation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;methods are determined to be appropriate and consistent within the industry, the use of different methodologies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;or&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;assumptions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;determine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;fair&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;certain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;assets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;liabilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;could result in a different estimate of fair value at the reporting date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 38.15pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;DCRT measures its financial instruments at fair value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The following table presents the fair value and hierarchy levels for the financial instruments as of March 31, 2026 and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; 31, 2025:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
