 style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;on notional amounts, interest rates, maturity date and other contract terms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;The fair values of the interest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;rate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;swap&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;contracts are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;valued&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;using&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;third-party.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;interest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;