&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol style="margin: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt;" start="7" type="1"&gt;
&lt;li style="margin-left: 20.29pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; padding-left: 15.46pt; font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt;Related-Party&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: 0.35pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt;Transactions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;In December 2015, the Company entered into a Management Services Agreement (&amp;#8220;MSA&amp;#8221;) with DCR Investor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The MSA was entered into to utilize DCR Investor&amp;#8217;s administrative and management resources. The MSA permits DCR Investor to bill the Company for administrative and management services performed directly by DCR Investor and certain of its affiliates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Under the MSA, DCR Investor also can seek reimbursement for costs associated with third party management services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The MSA is in effect until terminated by either of the parties in accordance with the agreement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;For the three months ended March 31, 2026 and 2025, the Company incurred total&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;costs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;$222,338 and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;$10,306,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;respectively,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;under&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;MSA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;As&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; March 31, 2026 and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;31,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;2025, the outstanding payable to DCR Investor was $451,106 and $228,769, respectively, included in Accounts payable and accrued expenses on the Balance Sheets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;MSA costs incurred through the Commercial Operations Date are capitalized and included in property, plant and equipment or construction work in progress on the Balance Sheets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;MSA costs incurred after the Commercial Operations Date are included in operating and maintenance expense on the Statement of Operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol style="margin: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt;" start="8" type="1"&gt;
&lt;li style="margin-left: 20.19pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; padding-left: 15.46pt; font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: normal;"&gt;Long&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: normal;"&gt;Term&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt;Debt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;On October 31, 2022, DCRT entered a Credit Agreement with MUFG Bank LTD, ING Capital LLC and Societe Generale, (the &amp;#8220;Lenders) for a Construction Loan of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;$264,163,349 and a Working Capital Loan of $5,000,000.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;There are letters of credits for unused portions of Construction and Working Capital Loans and a letter of credit for Debt Service Reserve of $11,219,185 to provide financing for TWL.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;DCRT incurred debt issuance costs of $4,991,694 as of December 31, 2022, which are included in Long term debt, net on the Balance Sheet as of March 31, 2026. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt;Construction &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;loan amounts under this contract amounted to $264,163,349 and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;was&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;included&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; Current and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Long&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt;-term &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;liabilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Balance Sheet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; Further, on June 28, 2024, the Construction Loan was converted into a Term Loan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;outstanding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Construction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Loan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; and Term Loan &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;bears interest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;either a Base&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Rate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Loan or a Secured Overnight Financing Rate (&amp;#8220;SOFR&amp;#8221;) Loan, as the Company may request.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The Base Rate is equal to the highest of (a) Prime Rate, (b) the Federal Funds Rate plus 0.5% and (c) Daily Simple SOFR plus 1.0%, provided that the Base Rate shall not be less than 0%.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The SOFR Rate shall be the Daily Simple Rate, which is the greater of SOFR or 0%.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The weighted average Base Rate plus a 1.75% spread as of March 31, 2026 and December 31, 2025 are 5.37% and 5.43%, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;There were no outstanding balances on the Working Capital Loan as of March 31, 2026 and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; 31, 2025. Upon term conversion, DCRT issued letters of credit under the Debt Service Reserve Letter of Credit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Construction Loan Letter of Credit fees are based on a rate of 1.75% for issued Letters of Credit and 0.5% for LC facility commitment fees.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Construction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Letter&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Credit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;fees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; the three months ended March 31, 2026 and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;2025,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;are $6,250, respectively. Project Letter of Credit fees are based on a rate of 1.75% for issued Letters of Credit and 0.5% for LC facility commitment fees. Project Letter of Credit fees for the three months&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; ended March 31, 2026 and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;2025, are $4,589, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Debt Service Reserve Letter of Credit fees are based on rates from 0.5% to 1.75%. Debt Service Reserve Letter of Credit fees for the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt;three months ended March 31, 2026 and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;2025, are $33,022, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 38.15pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Interest expenses incurred under the Term Loan amounted to $3,505,607 and $4,020,713 for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 0.65pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt;three months ended March 31, 2026 and 2025, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;respectively, and is included in Interest expense on the Statement of Operations. Interest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 1.45pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;payments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 1.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 1.45pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;made &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt;quarterly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Should&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;DCRT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;default&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;its repayment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Term&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Loan,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;creditors&amp;#8217;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;sole&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;recourse&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;against&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;DCRT is their ownership interest in Ten West Link.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;DCRT is subject to various debt covenants that specify the required use of funds and require DCRT to maintain certain debt service ratios for membership disbursements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;As of March 31, 2026 and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; 31, 2025, DCRT was in compliance with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;all debt covenants.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 35.8pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;As&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;March 31, 2026 and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; 31,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;2025,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; T&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;erm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;loan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;consisted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt;following:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
