&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 38.15pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 38.15pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol style="margin: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt;" start="10" type="1"&gt;
&lt;li style="margin-left: 25.85pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; padding-left: 9.9pt; font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: normal;"&gt;Derivative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.55pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: normal;"&gt;Hedging&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.6pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt;Instruments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 36.55pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;DCRT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;uses interest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;rate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;related derivative instruments to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;reduce&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;its exposure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;related&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;to changes in interest rates on its variable rate debt.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The Company enters into derivative instruments for the purpose of managing its market risks surrounding cash flows rather than speculating.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.65pt; margin-right: 36.55pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 36.55pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;By using derivative financial instruments to hedge exposures to changes in interest rates, the Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;exposes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;itself&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;to credit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;risk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;and market&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;risk.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;minimizes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;counterparty&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;credit risk by entering into derivative agreements with only high-quality counterparties.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The market risk associated&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the derivatives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;managed by&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;establishing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;monitoring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;parameters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;that limit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the types and degree of market risk that may be undertaken.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 36.55pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 36.55pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Interest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Rate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.35pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt;Swaps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 36.55pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;DCRT&amp;#8217;s variable rate SOFR debt obligation exposes DCRT to variability in interest payments due&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;to changes in interest rates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;To limit the variability of its interest payments, DCRT entered into SOFR-based interest rate swap agreements in 2022 to manage fluctuations in cash flows resulting from changes in the benchmark interest rate of SOFR.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The swap is used to convert the variable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;rate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;cash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;flow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;exposure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;DCRT&amp;#8217;s long-term debt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;fixed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;cash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;flows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 36.55pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 36.55pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Under&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;terms of the interest rate swap, DCRT pays or receives SOFR-based variable interest rate payments and fixed interest rate payments at interest rates of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;approximately 3.66% as of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;March 31, 2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;, thereby creating the equivalent of fixed rate debt for the notional amount of its debt hedged.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;For the three months ended March 31, 2026 and 2025, DCRT paid $13,075 and received $390,005, respectively, in net settlements under the interest rate swap agreements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 36.55pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 36.55pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;As of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;March 31, 2026 and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt; 31, 2025, the total notional amount of DCRT&amp;#8217;s outstanding interest rate swap&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;agreements were $232,917,534&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;$234,786,991,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;fair&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;interest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;rate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;swaps as of March 31, 2026 and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt; 31, 2025, was a net asset of $5,295,042 and $4,951,106, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;Changes in fair value of the interest rate swaps are included in regulatory assets or regulatory liabilities on the Balance Sheets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;For the three months ended March 31, 2026 and year ended December 31, 2025, changes in the fair value of $343,936&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;and $1,718,984, respectively, represented a regulatory liability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 38.15pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol style="margin: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt;" start="11" type="1"&gt;
&lt;li style="margin-top: 0.05pt; margin-left: 25.85pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; padding-left: 9.9pt; font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: normal;"&gt;Income Taxes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;In determining its interim tax provision, the Company reflects its estimated impact from its permanent and flow-through tax differences. The statutory Federal tax rate is 21% for 2026 and 2025. The Company also pays income tax in California, which has a state income tax rate of 8.84%. The Company&amp;#8217;s effective income tax rate for 2026 and 2025 was 25.7%, and 26.4%, respectively. Our effective tax rate differs from the federal statutory tax rate primarily due to flow-through impacts of AFUDC-Equity. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The Company remains subject to examination by federal and state tax authorities, subject to the appropriate statute of limitations. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol style="margin: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt;" start="12" type="1"&gt;
&lt;li style="margin-top: 0.05pt; margin-left: 25.85pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; padding-left: 9.9pt; font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: normal;"&gt;Commitments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.55pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: normal;"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt;Contingencies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 33pt 0pt 35.75pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;On August 31, 2018, the Company entered an Engineering, Procurement and Construction (&amp;#8220;EPC&amp;#8221;) Agreement for the construction of TWL in the amount of $193 million with EC Source Services, LLC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;On August 12, 2022, DCRT amended the original EPC contract with EC Source Services,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;LLC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;increase&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;amount&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;$318 million. Throughout construction, nine change orders were issued increasing the EC Source Services, LLC total contract amount to $323 million. The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;agreement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;lump&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;sum&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;turnkey&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;agreement and runs through construction to the final completion which has not yet been reached. Retainage of 10% is withheld on the EPC Agreement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;There was no retainage outstanding as of March 31, 2026 and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; 31, 2025. Costs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;incurred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;under&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;this&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;contract&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;amounted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.35pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;$-0-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.45pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the three months ended March 31, 2026 and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;2025,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;respectively,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;included&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;in Property, plant and equipment on the Balance Sheets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.55pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;On August 30, 2018, the Company entered an Engineering, Design and Procurement Agreement for the interconnection of the Facility with Southern California Edison Company (&amp;#8220;SCE&amp;#8221;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Costs incurred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;under&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;this&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;contract&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;amounted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;$-0-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;three months ended March 31, 2026 and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;2025, respectively, and are included in Property, plant and equipment on the Balance Sheets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0.65pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;On&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;June 1, 2023,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;entered&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;an&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Engineering,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Procurement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Agreement for the construction and interconnection of the Cielo Azul Switchyard with Barnard Construction Inc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Costs incurred under this contract amounted to $-0- for the three months ended March 31, 2026 and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;2025, respectively, and are included in Property, plant and equipment on the Balance Sheets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Retainage of 10% was withheld on 50% of the contract and the retainage outstanding as of March 31, 2026 and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; 31, 2025, was $-0-,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.45pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;respectively&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0.65pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0.65pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The Company is subject to property tax audits by various state and local taxing authorities, including California and Arizona, related primarily to assessed values for certain construction-period and placed-in-service assets. Based on information currently available and in accordance with ASC 450, Contingencies, management has concluded that it is probable that additional property tax assessments will be incurred for these matters and that the amount of the assessment is reasonably estimable. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0.65pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0.65pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0.65pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Accordingly, as of March 31, 2026 and December 31, 2025, the Company has recorded a liability of $18,677,235 and $16,683,954, respectively, which represents management&amp;#8217;s best estimate of the probable loss as of the balance sheet date. The ultimate resolution of these audits may differ from amounts accrued, and any such difference will be recognized in the period in which the matter is resolved or when additional information becomes available. To the extent additional property tax assessments are ultimately incurred, the Company expects recovery of such amounts through regulatory mechanisms; however, regulatory recovery is not considered in determining the amount of the recorded liability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0.65pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol style="margin: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt;" start="13" type="1"&gt;
&lt;li style="margin-left: 25.9pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; padding-left: 9.85pt; font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: normal;"&gt;Risks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: normal;"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt;Uncertainties&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0.05pt 35.9pt 0pt 35.75pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Pursuant &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;to the APSA, DCRT is subject to a cost cap for certain portions of TWL; however,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;such&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;costs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;exceeded&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;this&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; unadjusted &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;cap&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;materially.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;route&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;selected&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;by&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; United States Department of the Interior, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Bureau of Land Management (&amp;#8220;BLM&amp;#8221;) is approximately 11 miles longer than the original DCRT proposed route. This increase in route length, along with different structure requirements, additional access roads, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;additional private property easements, and other unexpected mitigation requirements directed by the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;BLM,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; had&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;an&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;TWL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;costs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Delays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;environmental&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.15pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;permitting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;process (particularly the federal NEPA and state of California CEQA/CPCN processes) impacted the overall Project schedule and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt;cost&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0.05pt 35.9pt 0pt 35.75pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0.05pt 35.9pt 0pt 35.75pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;On March 16, 2020, DCRT notified the CAISO per Article 13 of the APSA that due to the pandemic caused by COVID-19, performance under the APSA will likely be impacted and delayed due to this force majeure event. Significant delays and related costs, such as those related to the delayed issuance of the Certificate of Public Convenience and Necessity (&amp;#8220;CPCN&amp;#8221;) by the California Public Utilities Commission, have been incurred. Such costs and their impacts are addressed in the FPA section 205 filing with FERC made by DCRT on June 29, 2023&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0.05pt 35.9pt 0pt 35.75pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.05pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol style="margin: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt;" start="14" type="1"&gt;
&lt;li style="margin-top: 0.05pt; margin-left: 25.85pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; padding-left: 9.9pt; font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: normal;"&gt;Asset Retirement Obligation (&amp;#8220;ARO&amp;#8221;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.05pt; margin-left: 35.75pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The Company has certain legal obligations related to the dismantlement, restoration, and abandonment of its electric transmission assets. These obligations generally arise when transmission lines, substations, or other equipment are placed in service. The Company is required to record an ARO for these obligations based on the fair value of the dismantlement, restoration, and abandonment costs expected to be incurred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.05pt; margin-left: 35.75pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.05pt; margin-left: 35.75pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Quantified ARO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;As of March 31, 2026 and December 31, 2025, the Company has recognized an ARO liability of $17,150,175 and $16,914,222, respectively, for the dismantlement and removal of certain transmission assets. This liability reflects the present value of the estimated future costs associated with the dismantlement, restoration, and abandonment of these assets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The estimate is based on current legal requirements, existing technology, and expected future costs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Unquantified ARO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The Company also has additional AROs related to other electric transmission assets that have not been quantified due to significant uncertainty surrounding the timing and method of settlement of these obligations. The primary factors contributing to this uncertainty include the long-term nature of the obligations, potential changes in legal requirements, and the potential for technological advancements that may alter the expected costs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The Company is continuously evaluating its AROs and will recognize a liability when the fair value of the obligation can be reasonably estimated. Until such time, the Company will disclose the existence of these obligations and the factors contributing to the inability to quantify them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.05pt; margin-left: 35.75pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.05pt; margin-left: 35.75pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol style="margin: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt;" start="15" type="1"&gt;
&lt;li style="margin-top: 0.05pt; margin-left: 25.85pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; padding-left: 9.9pt; font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.05pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: normal;"&gt;Subsequent Event&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 38.15pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The Company has evaluated subsequent events for adjustment to or disclosure in its financial statements through May 29, 2026 and has not identified any subsequent events that require disclosure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
