  <link:footnoteLink xlink:type="extended" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/link">
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH11B7F2C24E704F556DE0B45FF64C078A" xlink:label="HH11B7F2C24E704F556DE0B45FF64C078A" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH2F588AF99F3BBCBDB908B237B5CB676D" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p style="text-align: left">
          <span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Amounts include $7,649,045 Plant that is not recoverable through rates and $75,631,720 of property that was funded through customer advances.</span>
          <br />
        </p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH11B7F2C24E704F556DE0B45FF64C078A" xlink:to="HH2F588AF99F3BBCBDB908B237B5CB676D" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH709B60A210F77C63F8CB0F0167F9151C" xlink:label="HH709B60A210F77C63F8CB0F0167F9151C" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH51B7F95888E6C7D596ACD9FB238E5DB9" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p style="text-align: left">
          <span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Amounts include $229,414 of accumulated depreciation on $7,649,045 of Plant that is not recoverable through rates.</span>
          <br />
        </p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH709B60A210F77C63F8CB0F0167F9151C" xlink:to="HH51B7F95888E6C7D596ACD9FB238E5DB9" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH7A59359881B84BC39EC733FED6A1670A" xlink:label="HH7A59359881B84BC39EC733FED6A1670A" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH1962BAFFEC46998BD49F22BBB295141F" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>The Company has recorded a contingent liability for the probable assessment of property taxes as a result of ongoing audits by Arizona and California. Because the Company includes a tracking mechanism for property taxes to ensure that customers fund only property taxes that are paid to taxing jurisdictions, a regulatory asset was recorded to represent the expected customer funding of the property tax assessment.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH7A59359881B84BC39EC733FED6A1670A" xlink:to="HH1962BAFFEC46998BD49F22BBB295141F" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH453C82CB36F6A459F4BA5476F8ACFFDD" xlink:label="HH453C82CB36F6A459F4BA5476F8ACFFDD" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH93C985AECEF9A144C8B526B391B099F4" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Amounts include $24,217 of depreciation expense on $5 million of plant that is not recoverable through rates.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH453C82CB36F6A459F4BA5476F8ACFFDD" xlink:to="HH93C985AECEF9A144C8B526B391B099F4" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH185580C71D3528043054260CFCBE4299" xlink:label="HH185580C71D3528043054260CFCBE4299" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHF7D332C36F66D067213111792764660C" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Amounts include $7,649,045 Plant that is not recoverable through rates and $75,631,720 of property that was funded through customer advances.</div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH185580C71D3528043054260CFCBE4299" xlink:to="HHF7D332C36F66D067213111792764660C" order="1" />
